  "instructions": [
    "heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat",
    "add the onion and garlic and cook, stirring occasionally, until softened, about 5 minutes",
    "add the cherry tomatoes and cook, stirring occasionally, until they start to release their juices, about 5 minutes",
    "add the white fish fillet and cook, stirring occasionally, until cooked through, about 5-7 minutes",
    "season with salt and black pepper to taste",
    "garnish with fresh parsley and a squeeze of lemon juice",
    "serve hot, spooning some of the deglazed fond over the top"
